    after: **Platform note**: `__fp16` scalar type and `FCVTN`/`FCVTL` NEON conversions work on Cortex-A57
(Armv8.0-A) despite `__ARM_FEATURE_FP16_VECTOR_ARITHMETIC` being undefined. That macro gates fp16
